  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３楼　摊位街\n　“半生不熟厨房”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗和美鹤正在深入交谈……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 06}……啊，学长。\n刚才真是危险呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}是Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ袭击的时候吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}白钟，多亏你随机应变，\n才逃过一劫。\n让我再次向你道谢。谢谢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3E 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}虽然良心多少有些不安……\n不过，能得救真是太好了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，只用容易买到的食材，\n竟然就能做出那种威力……\n实在很有研究价值……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}是的，比起材料，\n我认为烹调方法中存在特殊工序。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}可是……烹调方法\n应该也就那么几种……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}无论如何，那是能让强大的阴影\n瞬间昏倒的物质。\n就这样放着太可惜了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}果然还是想带回集团的研究所。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_160.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}完全就是凶器呢……\n……啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
